member.remarks:
0.8 m. The retail speaker takes the ordinary damage message through its own collision mesh;
legacy/ballistic contacts do not always retain the struck task, so nearness to the resolved
head placement stands in there. The lamp is a ~30 cm box — this is forgiving without being magnetic.

remarks.para:
Sizes and parameter counts, from the registrars: PictureBox (0x41B310) 2556 bytes and
4; TextBox (0x41AAF0) 8772 and 5; InputBox (0x41D080) 424 and 6;
AsciiBox (0x41C700) 248 and 4; ScrollListBox (0x41B8E0) 5116 and 7;
TypeWriterBox (0x41A1E0) 136 and 2.

 and  move the selection and are handled by the manager;
,  and  are forwarded to the selected
item, which is how a slider or a toggle takes input.

remarks.code:
zone    = ZoneOf(hit);
damage  = zoneMultiplier[zone] * damageFactor;
perZone[zone] += damage;
total         += damage;
if (total >= maximumHealth) dead = true;

member.remarks:
Bones 20, 21 and 22 hang off spine bone 1 and run more than a metre forward of the chest;
bone 22 is where a held weapon attaches (). No
skinned human body references any of the three, so they carry no geometry to be shot.

remarks.para:
Which rays are live depends on whether you are standing. On the ground the ankle-height ray
is skipped and only the middle and high ones are cast, so you walk over kerbs instead of into them;
airborne, all three are live. See .

member.remarks:
Argument 12, and the first thing 0x47ABD0 tests. True for the rifle and pistol calibres;
false for shotgun shells, the 1000 calibre and every special type — none of which fires a
visible round.

Its open and closed flags (+409/+410) are written only at the end of its update (0x446D10);
the constructor (0x4468F0) leaves them as the allocation found them, and the lock flag (+408) at
nought. A door in a section the level has not streamed in yet reports none of them.

A tangent rather than a distance, because the crosshair is an angle. A fixed radius would make a
tube across the room almost impossible to hit while making the one overhead impossible to miss;
about a degree and a half is roughly the size of the reticle and behaves the same at every range.

Train initialization (0x42A150) stores abs(v0.x) / abs(v0.x - v1.x) at
Train+1864. The consist updater later interpolates the two railroad samples by this fraction;
omitting it places the model origin on its front coupler instead of inside the car.
